[{"title":"赠孔止武横州学正 其一","author":"金幼孜","text":"妙年学礼独超群，早领乡书会缙绅。\n喜见姓名登乙榜，十年不负读书勤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4671,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠孔止武横州学正 其二","author":"金幼孜","text":"承恩晓出五云端，为向横州作教官。\n圣主崇儒资教育，逢人休叹座毡寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4672,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠孔止武横州学正 其三","author":"金幼孜","text":"御沟新涨雨初晴，杨柳毵毵啭早莺。\n朝罢都门一相送，故乡回首不胜情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4673,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠孔止武横州学正 其四","author":"金幼孜","text":"便道还乡两月程，綵衣偏胜锦衣荣。\n到家且慰双亲望，膝下频将寿酒倾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4674,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠孔止武横州学正 其五","author":"金幼孜","text":"骊驹早发向横州，远道风烟莫滞留。\n五岭秋来有回雁，平安先寄凤池头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4675,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为马通政题画 其一","author":"金幼孜","text":"海棠花发过春寒，花上禽啼宿雨乾。\n双双不惜头俱白，犹向东风弄羽翰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4676,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为马通政题画 其二","author":"金幼孜","text":"谁教寒皋语自圆，可人毛羽更新鲜。\n上林千树堪栖息，应见高飞近日边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4677,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写怀十首录寄诸兄弟 其一","author":"金幼孜","text":"忽忽离家十五年，每怀桑梓独潸然。\n东风寒食南源路，洒饭空令忆墓田。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4678,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写怀十首录寄诸兄弟 其二","author":"金幼孜","text":"南北驱驰鬓已皤，西江万里隔烟波。\n池头旧种黄柑树，结实秋来有几多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4679,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写怀十首录寄诸兄弟 其三","author":"金幼孜","text":"慈亲日夜系深思，梦里常怀见面迟。\n近得好音相慰藉，为言强健胜前时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4680,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写怀十首录寄诸兄弟 其四","author":"金幼孜","text":"先公遗德在江乡，死后人传姓字香。\n圣主恩深推锡命，千年黄壤有煇光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4681,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写怀十首录寄诸兄弟 其五","author":"金幼孜","text":"伯氏行年五十强，年年旅食客他乡。\n别来十载知无恙，姜被何时共客床。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4682,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写怀十首录寄诸兄弟 其六","author":"金幼孜","text":"诸弟持家力有馀，田园生计未应疏。\n堂中奉母多馀暇，好共诸郎更读书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4683,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写怀十首录寄诸兄弟 其七","author":"金幼孜","text":"忆昨穷经慕昔贤，岁寒冰雪伴青毡。\n一从天上登科后，无复篝灯事简编。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4684,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写怀十首录寄诸兄弟 其八","author":"金幼孜","text":"绕屋青山绿树稠，春来啼鸟自啁啾。\n回来登览知何似，几度临风慨昔游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4685,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写怀十首录寄诸兄弟 其九","author":"金幼孜","text":"久别亲朋觉已疏，频年不得半行书。\n平生经术惭无补，空有虚名在石渠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4686,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写怀十首录寄诸兄弟 其十","author":"金幼孜","text":"老我于今幸有孙，前人积德至今存。\n馀生倘遂归田计，教育犹思淑后昆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4687,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄友人郭房陵 其一","author":"金幼孜","text":"京华别后频相忆，尚想风流似昔年。\n前日德州曾借问，寻君不见思悽然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4688,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄友人郭房陵 其二","author":"金幼孜","text":"数从马首问平安，远道怀人有万端。\n白首鲸川归未得，谁知为客独艰难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4689,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画牛 其一","author":"金幼孜","text":"服箱力穑不知年，报主多情只自怜。\n好是野田春种后，饱肥芳草卧深烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4690,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画牛 其二","author":"金幼孜","text":"牧童原上催归急，远树微茫带夕曛。\n前日东郊曾扈从，野人牵进沐恩频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4691,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为大理寺丞马麟题画马 其一","author":"金幼孜","text":"万里曾思度玉门，归来立仗卸櫜鞬。\n饱肥苜蓿风霜晚，未老犹思报主恩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4692,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为大理寺丞马麟题画马 其二","author":"金幼孜","text":"异种由来产渥洼，曾看入贡度流沙。\n几回牵向瑶池过，新濯龙文照五花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4693,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山水图","author":"金幼孜","text":"忆过彭蠡看庐山，九叠云屏倚翠鬟。\n今日看图山更好，似闻飞瀑落云间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4694,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒梅冻雀","author":"金幼孜","text":"繁蕊初开满玉条，碧梢低亚影萧萧。\n天寒冻雀双栖稳，却怪朝来雪未消。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4695,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"枯荷鹡鸰","author":"金幼孜","text":"林塘秋尽水波寒，荷叶无声半已残。\n日暮鹡鸰栖不起，藕花深处露漙漙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4696,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"生菜为神乐观道者作","author":"金幼孜","text":"手种青蔬不用锄，白云为圃自芬敷。\n南郊夜宿邀同饭，却忆清斋味有馀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4697,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白莲为乐舞生赋","author":"金幼孜","text":"秋水清涵白玉盘，露华净洗镜光寒。\n几回欲载吹箫侣，共向瑶池月下看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4698,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂画为师尚书逵赋 其一 双清松鹤","author":"金幼孜","text":"脩翎如雪自飘飘，饮啄寻常不受招。\n野阔天高秋万里，长鸣直欲上青霄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4699,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂画为师尚书逵赋 其二 梅雪金鸡","author":"金幼孜","text":"扶桑浴日梦初醒，天上曾闻送好声。\n却爱羽毛成五色，梅花照影雪初晴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4700,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂画为师尚书逵赋 其三 竹雪山鹊","author":"金幼孜","text":"雪满琼林冻不开，数竿如玉立崔嵬。\n闭门尽日无人到，山鹊一双飞下来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4701,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂画为师尚书逵赋 其四 牧马图","author":"金幼孜","text":"骅骝騕䮍并传闻，牝牡骊黄竟莫分。\n圣代只今多入贡，大宛龙种动成群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4702,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂画为师尚书逵赋 其五 聚禽图","author":"金幼孜","text":"绛桃枝上雨初晴，相唤相呼更有情。\n上林千树花如锦，好向朝阳杂凤声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4703,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题赵仲穆马","author":"金幼孜","text":"房星夜堕渥洼中，一片玄云覆玉騣。\n远人知是真龙种，万里牵来献九重。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4704,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题王熙临宣和雪天芦雁","author":"金幼孜","text":"端本堂中迹已空，兴亡总在画图中。\n惟有干难河上路，年年飞雪送归鸿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4705,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题郭鱼台古图小景 其一","author":"金幼孜","text":"仙馆清虚似广寒，碧纱低卷映琅玕。\n天风半夜吹残梦，自把琼箫度紫鸾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4706,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题郭鱼台古图小景 其二","author":"金幼孜","text":"银河露下散微凉，画扇金屏度好香。\n苍雪万竿清透骨，卧听仙乐过潇湘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4707,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题方尚书宾山水图","author":"金幼孜","text":"浩荡湖山天际来，云屏九叠立崔嵬。\n花边小艇缘溪水，洞口茅亭倚树开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4708,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凯旋诗 其一","author":"金幼孜","text":"圣主承天统万方，梯山航海尽来王。\n不应残丑犹乌合，屡犯边疆恣夺攘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4709,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凯旋诗 其二","author":"金幼孜","text":"天威赫怒整彤弧，万骑如云从乘舆。\n白日风雷严号令，指挥掌握仗神谟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4710,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凯旋诗 其三","author":"金幼孜","text":"斧钺煌煌出九天，旌旗千里照山川。\n桓桓武士排山岳，争道从龙近日边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4711,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凯旋诗 其四","author":"金幼孜","text":"昨夜旄头闇不明，忽传强敌向南行。\n三千铁骑争追逐，尽卷穹庐入塞城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4712,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凯旋诗 其五","author":"金幼孜","text":"金鼓喧阗尽日闻，欢声雷动及军门。\n六师斩馘知无算，驼马驱来动百群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4713,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凯旋诗 其六","author":"金幼孜","text":"圣皇除暴在安民，神武由来合至仁。\n纳款绥降宽大罚，尽令生育在阳春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4714,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凯旋诗 其七","author":"金幼孜","text":"铁骑长驱蹴塞云，扫清沙漠荡尘氛。\n从今边籞无烽燧，圣武神功荷至尊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4715,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凯旋诗 其八","author":"金幼孜","text":"凯奏欢呼入帝乡，天戈一指靖遐荒。\n臣民快睹平边诏，万岁声中祝圣皇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4716,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凯旋诗 其九","author":"金幼孜","text":"周宣北伐中兴时，纪述于今尚有诗。\n此日时巡因阅武，尽歼群寇镇边陲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4717,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凯旋诗 其十","author":"金幼孜","text":"绝塞萧条迹已空，霆轰电扫大荒中。\n磨厓须勒燕然石，万世神功继太宗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4718,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凯旋诗 其十一","author":"金幼孜","text":"万乘巡边奏凯旋，千官齐贺九重天。\n河清海晏升平日，一统华夷万万年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4719,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凯旋诗 其十二","author":"金幼孜","text":"寰宇清平乐世康，雨旸时顺岁丰穰。\n皇图久远同天地，宗社尊安圣寿昌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4720,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"万竿烟雨图为袁生大鹗题","author":"金幼孜","text":"满林烟雨晓濛濛，万个琅玕半淡浓。\n向晚江风吹不散，无端飞翠入帘栊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4721,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋江待渡图为席咸宁赋","author":"金幼孜","text":"秋山叠叠映云萝，渺渺长空接远波。\n日暮小舟争渡急，行人犹唱竹枝歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4722,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"万松图题寄幼学贤弟 其一","author":"金幼孜","text":"一别乡园廿四春，种来松树已成村。\n寄言孙子须培植，剪伐无令及本根。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4723,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"万松图题寄幼学贤弟 其二","author":"金幼孜","text":"种得长松万个多，连山数里暗烟萝。\n何时投老归乡曲，分我寒岩翠一坡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4724,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立春日朝罢偶赋 其一","author":"金幼孜","text":"东郊击鼓送春回，阙下趋朝玉漏催。\n岁岁黄柑传腊酒，千官先进万年杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4725,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立春日朝罢偶赋 其二","author":"金幼孜","text":"春盘春酒开春宴，几得簪花侍御筵。\n圣主只今恩似海，人人齐贺太平年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4726,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立春日朝罢偶赋 其三","author":"金幼孜","text":"隔岁立春先十日，东风已觉到天涯。\n钗头綵胜簪来好，莫笑酡颜鬓已华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4727,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题墨梅","author":"金幼孜","text":"姑射仙人不可招，月明瑶圃路迢迢。\n梦回犹忆西湖上，雪树参差暗野桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4728,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题墨竹为郑诚御史作","author":"金幼孜","text":"虚心劲节倚云端，白日清风散羽翰。\n几度趋朝闻凤管，月明犹想佩珊珊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4729,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朝回独坐忆幼男武安 其一","author":"金幼孜","text":"每日朝回对板扉，一回相忆一回悲。\n阶前独步寻行迹，犹想牵衣似昔时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4730,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朝回独坐忆幼男武安 其二","author":"金幼孜","text":"语笑常时近我傍，为宽怀抱解愁肠。\n每从膝下供茶果，时向灯前劝酒觞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4731,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朝回独坐忆幼男武安 其三","author":"金幼孜","text":"秀目宽眉骨格高，短衫窄袖小绒绦。\n阶前恁地趋跄好，来往人称是凤毛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f7968